A Philly menu in four stickers: a cheesesteak, a cup of wooder ice, pork roll and scrapple. All the flavor, none of the grease on your laptop.

What&#39;s in the pack (4 stickers):
• Cheesesteak: 3.22&quot; × 1.76&quot;
• Wooder Ice: 1.76&quot; × 3.2&quot;
• Pork Roll: 1.95&quot; × 1.95&quot;
• Scrapple: 1.95&quot; × 1.95&quot;

Choose your finish (the whole pack comes in the finish you pick):
• Glossy: glossy laminated, waterproof vinyl
• Holographic: sparkly, light-catching finish (sparkle looks different in every light)

Drawn, designed, printed, and cut by me, who I am told is a human. No AI was used in the creation of these stickers.

